                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-7210**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| medium  | libpython3.12-minimal  | 3.12.3-1ubuntu0.17  |   | deb  | /var/lib/dpkg/info/libpython3.12-minimal:amd64.conffiles  | ubuntu:distro:ubuntu:24.04  | [CVE-2026-7210](https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-7210)  |\n"
