                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-40228**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| low  | libudev1  | 255.4-1ubuntu8.17  |   | deb  | /var/lib/dpkg/status  | ubuntu:distro:ubuntu:24.04  | [CVE-2026-40228](https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-40228)  |\n"
